Rips_Refund
├── when the round does not exist
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the round exists
    ├── when the round is not expired
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when the round is expired
        ├── when the caller has already been refunded
        │   └── it should revert.
        └── when the caller has not been refunded
            ├── when the caller has no tickets in the round
            │   └── it should revert.
            └── when the caller has tickets in the round
                ├── it should mark the caller as refunded.
                ├── it should transfer the refund amount.
                └── it should emit a {RefundIssued} event.
